{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_title", "source_sha256": "eff8b6fc83d166e9088ec1d2e3f29a8dec89136976432fa37fda1a5849eec6c9", "ja": "ちいさな一歩でも", "zh": "哪怕只是微小的一步", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_synopsis", "source_sha256": "920b1cac903d23f719dea92977ad33fed3f823765d604d5bcbc4e5b39f88604a", "ja": "定期公演で新曲を披露する事になった可憐。\n雑誌の密着取材が入る事になったが、上手く\n対応できず落ち込んでしまう。しかしプロデ\nューサーに「成長している」と励まされ、見\n事に公演をやり遂げるのだった。", "zh": "可怜决定在定期公演中带来新曲表演。\n虽然迎来了杂志的跟拍采访，但她却因\n应对不佳而陷入了沮丧。不过在制作人\n“你一直在成长”的鼓励下，她最终精\n彩地完成了整场公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1000_p", "source_sha256": "47fd97ef80416e052c466ecbf9f0c5731f27ec7653faf0b5242943cc375c35d7", "ja": "（今日はいよいよ密着取材初日……なんだが、さっそく\nみんな、ダンスレッスンの動きが硬い気がするな）", "zh": "（今天终于是跟拍采访的第一天……不过，总觉得大家刚开始跳舞练习时动作就有点僵硬啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "7b7ed5396fdeef9c5ac1b9d096cbca77b5dd186b6ed7581d3e82fd9df3b1670f", "ja": "やっぱり、カメラに密着されているって思うと、\n緊張しちゃいますね……。", "zh": "果然，一想到有摄影机全程跟拍，就会紧张起来呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1002_camman", "source_sha256": "0c6cc113394df0f03fdbb2cf0fd7fc823cab3f2f2cbbe55ea653c08850aaea24", "ja": "皆さん、普段通りでお願いしまーす。", "zh": "大家，请像平时一样就好——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1003_journalist", "source_sha256": "86919c21425aff5eab5c0e657c4f5f681b2005346a7657f51d630d7f5aaebef3", "ja": "私達スタッフの事は、空気だと思ってくださいね～。", "zh": "请把我们这些工作人员当成空气就好啦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1004_045kar", "source_sha256": "4c356b73ea3c31ff8d004308383d2354deeeb7e37396ea32798bc7910c358927", "ja": "う、うぅ……どうしても、意識しちゃう……。\nさっきから、何回もステップ、間違えちゃって……。", "zh": "呜、呜呜……不管怎样，还是会意识到……  \n从刚才开始，已经好几次跳错步了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1005_p", "source_sha256": "ddd19c3edca9d1e6491c9a1f8538a12a7b6c5380bb5fbd3c843036e3b1903606", "ja": "うーん、まあ、いったん休憩にしようか。\n何かリラックスできる方法があるといいんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯……那就先休息一下吧。\n要是有能放松下来的办法就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "485078481170d7c43f5be31598ed40ac73cb0e09a1b00697754712a5c132f553", "ja": "そうですね。ほどよい緊張ならともかく、\n体が硬くなっちゃうと怪我の元ですし……。", "zh": "是啊。适度的紧张倒还好，可要是身体变得僵硬，就容易受伤了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1007_008tak", "source_sha256": "f20aba1ece5b3c33afa792871f221377a414bef671b97ad38525e95baefc3893", "ja": "でしたら、可憐の好きなあれを焚いて\nみてはどうでしょうか？　あろま、と言いましたか。", "zh": "那么，不如点上可怜喜欢的那个试试？您说的是香薰吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1008_045kar", "source_sha256": "d53bfe32e99486a8e5fe0017dded253e7fea9ae16d4ca1418d96b6062973df0f", "ja": "あ……！　は、はい、いい考えだと思います……！\nす、すぐに準備しますね……！", "zh": "啊……！我、我觉得这是个好主意……！\n我、我马上准备……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1009_null", "source_sha256": "023360902a64d8be3ae477de9077c0ec601c9441f3d08c107abc4ea59f57c36c", "ja": "フワッ……♪", "zh": "轻飘飘……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "f5f01fd118bab2b219397dcbd3fb919a715d380db7673d9d0e1825e1d738aca8", "ja": "はぁ……めっちゃ和む～。\n可憐のアロマって、効果バツグンだよな。", "zh": "哈啊……真是让人放松～。\n可怜的香薰效果真棒啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1011_045kar", "source_sha256": "656465d3fef16e188163ae5a21d4b56d06ca6e2b60ecddf5f956aef3da17575b", "ja": "よ、よかった……ローズウッドは、緊張を\n和らげる効果があるから……ピッタリかなって。", "zh": "太、太好了……花梨木有缓解紧张的\n效果……所以我想应该正合适。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1012_008tak", "source_sha256": "63e7e864157b90d2c80450558e7ba401c86680581b5461c4dbcd3b7bfb76fc01", "ja": "このまましばし休息を取れば、落ち着いて\n再開できそうですね。可憐、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "照这样稍作休息一会儿，应该就能冷静下来重新开始了。可怜，谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1013_045kar", "source_sha256": "b613f6a8621dcdbf2ec30c6da9033e3fcb28941cdbb13403d04d49a6577d67dd", "ja": "い、いえ……！\n提案してくれたのは、貴音さんだから……。", "zh": "没、没有啦……！\n提出这个建议的，是贵音小姐才对……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "fff05f6b8121302da6119dcd1ef64fe4b76b6a4465d3145970363142a38fccdd", "ja": "そうだ！　みなさん、\n休憩のお供にクッキーはいかがですか？", "zh": "对了！各位，要不要来点饼干，陪大家一起休息呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "ac46f591bb07295928a6cd938c81b476117e1d8e9e30b6be5eb8305fe67566e9", "ja": "今日、差し入れにもってこようと思って、\nママと一緒に作ってきたんです！", "zh": "我想着今天带点慰问品来，就和妈妈一起做了些饼干！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1016_027say", "source_sha256": "90ce1c9c31c8bf29eb8cdbce3928a248046fd4788c3257e135e294aa2d3b2df9", "ja": "わあ、甘いものはすっごくありがたいなぁ……！\n星梨花ちゃん、もらっちゃっていいの？", "zh": "哇，甜食真是太让人感激了……！\n星梨花，可以收下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "53d297c2edf2d76262765c9c1b207f0e8587c3e283573c961163c1d1cb9f4278", "ja": "はい！　たくさん焼いてきたので、\nたくさん食べてください♪", "zh": "好的！我烤了很多，\n请多吃一点哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1018_045kar", "source_sha256": "42fd7cec3f3a52215ce21ff3ffce36989d8c895c4ecdbac81d0213dccf61880f", "ja": "あ、あの！　それなら私、水出しのハーブティーを\n作って来たので……の、飲みますか？", "zh": "啊、那个！既然这样，我泡了冷泡花草茶带过来……要、要喝吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "463a5556318ade8cf9c5c4d6d4d2fc9e1467dbe4be1fe021fe9d09ea915fa59c", "ja": "マジ？　サンキュー、可憐！\nちょうど喉も渇いてたし、助かるぜ～♪", "zh": "真的吗？谢谢你，可怜！\n我正好也口渴了，帮大忙了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1021_027say", "source_sha256": "1b67a190d16e1b28ad747f8b3225ad5a2fc192fbdcd2b5f126854768732d75fd", "ja": "はぁ……♪　すっかりリラックスしちゃったね！", "zh": "哈啊……♪　彻底放松下来了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1022_022ser", "source_sha256": "a2230770c0006f1acaba627fb62b3db1ce35009602c4f87933640808d3b881dc", "ja": "ふわぁ……あっ、ご、ごめんなさい！\nあくびが出ちゃいました……。", "zh": "呼啊……啊，对、对不起！不小心打哈欠了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1023_p", "source_sha256": "d22dabda00d00eccca916a2656e7548617f5765b5df0fa2d8d4b82c1e0bf59ab", "ja": "なんか今度は、緊張感がなくなっちゃった気は\nするけどな……ふわぁ……おっと。", "zh": "总觉得这次好像又没什么紧张感了……哈啊……哎呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1024_camman", "source_sha256": "3a4ff76f2d5743017dddcdb159ab4fc37539cccfd6376c379e8fe75f388c835b", "ja": "はは、皆さん、いい表情ですね！　\nこういうシーンも大事ですから。いただきます！", "zh": "哈哈，大家的表情都很不错呢！\n这种场景也很重要。那我就收下了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1025_027say", "source_sha256": "b8c103b1c106047a225fa1f9a20ea320b1b944b789907d375193666df8127cfd", "ja": "よ～し！　それじゃあ、ダンスレッスン再開だね！\nまずはもう一度、基本的なステップからやってみよう！", "zh": "好～嘞！那么，继续开始舞蹈练习吧！\n首先再来一次，从基本步伐练起吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1026_027say", "source_sha256": "43b62297e38a7e286f9e03f3366f2f69ae361927342d5f16331aea79224f6948", "ja": "それが終わったら、みんなで一度合わせてみて、\n課題点を擦り合わせていこうね！", "zh": "结束后，大家一起合练一遍，再把需要改进的地方统一一下吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1027_047sub", "source_sha256": "690e9e21451f9368940b5db0fd6fa24c6de971b011afebec0097559eec3dd3b4", "ja": "オッケー！　たっぷり休憩してリラックスできたし、\n気合い入れていくぜ～！", "zh": "好的！休息得很充分，也放松好了，\n接下来打起精神上吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1028_journalist", "source_sha256": "4d699eeb114fd40c6cae53061596641f199a3c9aa5677747c907b83f4c72235f", "ja": "なるほど……高山さんはリーダーシップがある。\nそれに永吉さん、小柄なのに勢いがあっていいね。", "zh": "原来如此……高山小姐很有领导力。\n而且永吉小姐虽然个子娇小，却很有冲劲，不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1029_camman", "source_sha256": "8d9d31378189ca093263de105c953a93ad01ce5b596a7c3e368517c0d4ad6adc", "ja": "ですね。四条さんはやっぱりカメラ映えします。\nいい画が撮れてますよ。本番も楽しみだなぁ。", "zh": "是啊。四条小姐果然很上镜。\n拍出了很棒的画面。真期待正式演出啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1030_045kar", "source_sha256": "2c0a14c4dee7358fb8f50f67a06bbe0bf06edbc8edf55ef416055500e6928c1f", "ja": "…………っ。", "zh": "…………唔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1031_p", "source_sha256": "ca8f4d18b97c53591a886cf3de4df39f01d4c153948c8be35797da4d781ae923", "ja": "……ん？　可憐？", "zh": "……嗯？可怜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1032_045kar", "source_sha256": "88dec2f8abdfc9d2dfee4bf07a6c19ff66726dc7973d8101e019934e36dd5271", "ja": "あっ、い、いえ……な、なんでもありません。\n私も……ダンス、が、がんばります……！", "zh": "啊，不、不是……没、没什么。\n我也……会、会努力练习舞蹈的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1033_journalist", "source_sha256": "8413e67fd19cf2028c4d61edf3b930da910ee103b7b947b5b1c18300a256bc53", "ja": "それでは、次は篠宮さんと四条さんのインタビュー\nになります。よろしくお願いしますね！", "zh": "那么，接下来是对篠宫小姐和四条小姐的采访。请多多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1034_045kar", "source_sha256": "d35ac83b78b5e5c61354f61d823e5d391a56aef0fd9c5fe3aa2ee1ccc71c71b7", "ja": "は、はい……！　よろしくお願いします……！", "zh": "好、好的……！请多关照……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1035_journalist", "source_sha256": "3a38dbb03e384a2424adf65402dfdbea5b0d06ab4991010b08625ba72ef77876", "ja": "では早速……これは高山さん達にも聞いたんですが、\n次の公演、どんな風にしたいとかってあります？", "zh": "那么就直接开始吧……这个我也问过高山小姐她们了，你们对下一场公演有没有什么想法，比如想做成什么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1036_045kar", "source_sha256": "c4434158178110538caaba3e59504bfd3265ff79e46f100e54fd4048bc3c6c54", "ja": "え、えっと……わ、私にとっては新曲を歌わせてもらう\n特別な公演なので……いいステージにしたくて……。", "zh": "呃，那个……对、对我来说，这是能演唱新歌的特别公演……所以……我想把它办成一场精彩的演出……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1037_journalist", "source_sha256": "03e54376eb23d648fe921d2c775316c1c1c7c5a479b3dbcb2e3177c80fbb5c9c", "ja": "なるほど。\nいいステージというと、具体的にはどのような？", "zh": "原来如此。\n你说的精彩舞台，具体是怎样的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1038_045kar", "source_sha256": "e6c0d2ae92ad76f4500b3abd2ccdcdfe427b695925b46710ba52b14e6f3c62f2", "ja": "え、ええと、ぐ、具体的に……ですか？\nそれは……その……。", "zh": "诶、呃，您、您问具体的……吗？\n这个……那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1039_008tak", "source_sha256": "cb808657ffb4d7b0ba0555764e1123772276e5016113dfec0b100990991a1ccc", "ja": "可憐、慌てて答えなくても大丈夫です。\nゆっくり……自分のぺーすでいいのですよ。", "zh": "可怜，不用慌着回答也没关系的。\n慢慢来……按自己的节奏就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1040_045kar", "source_sha256": "bdc3e6dac15413ad7b545c948ef0e8d24b87a892566354275c9258a94f251acb", "ja": "た、貴音さん……う、うぅ。", "zh": "贵音小姐……呜、呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1041_008tak", "source_sha256": "a6c1274ad043355b5d31dfc86c155da5fc95677786fe9769f9a3dc226efe109b", "ja": "とはいえ、まだレッスンも初日ですから、未定な\n部分も多く。具体的な説明は難しいかもしれません。", "zh": "话虽如此，毕竟今天才是训练的第一天，还有很多部分尚未确定。可能很难做出具体说明。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1042_journalist", "source_sha256": "f99d09f0309f7024400e5c44fcd0145c606006a4fd52eb2e4deee8bee9f9df60", "ja": "なるほど、そうですよね。失礼しました！\nでは次の質問に移りますが……。", "zh": "原来如此，确实是这样。失礼了！\n那么接下来进入下一个问题，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1043_045kar", "source_sha256": "a71c5fac9ee1338ac1f09ed152d78f60bfc91a2f9e025ed1117a6e601a61825b", "ja": "た、貴音さん……ありがとうございました……。\n私……うまく質問に答えられなくて……。", "zh": "贵音……谢谢您……  \n我……没能好好回答问题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1044_008tak", "source_sha256": "7e27db6ec4ff58555e5914dd4539a50e70ed136807603286b050d36f7c5ebc17", "ja": "可憐、気にせずに……しかし、具体的ないめーじを\n持っておくのは大切かもしれませんね。", "zh": "可怜，无须介怀……不过，事先构想好具体的画面\n或许也是很重要的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1045_008tak", "source_sha256": "7394bf0aea3ffa7a0ea6007d2217bdebfbf27ed0c342d09e0c76144635f5196c", "ja": "時間はありますから、じっくり考えてはどうでしょう？\n私も、自分の公演の時は悩みましたから。", "zh": "时间还充裕，慢慢想想如何？我自己在准备演出的时候，也曾为此烦恼过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1046_045kar", "source_sha256": "a7de2ebe73069badef059ad06c6230078c9e7c079e2fb6bc096dc1f52193c32e", "ja": "そ、そうですね……。そうしてみます……。\n公演のことも……その他のことも……。", "zh": "是、是啊……那我就试试看……。\n演出的事……还有其他的事……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1048_p", "source_sha256": "00da82c0551b82506eeac496b73cfd5d0c5be548adc8ba1e4126d8c470996284", "ja": "（なんとか初日が終わったな……ん？　あれは……。\n可憐のカバンが残ってる。まだ帰ってないのか……？）", "zh": "（总算结束第一天的公演了……嗯？那是……\n可怜的包还留在这里。她还没回去吗……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1049_102mis", "source_sha256": "2f73c4c948016201292d330dc7a374bd50d1a5a9f4c02ffde35b9fe01c4a04a1", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです。\n取材スタッフのみなさん、お帰りになりました。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了。\n采访组的各位已经回去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1050_p", "source_sha256": "960c1246f28c2c8017aa0259fe9b1ab78991b1e0b39e8e912f3afbef1e6c45d6", "ja": "ああ、ありがとうございます、青羽さん、\nところで、可憐をどこかで見かけませんでしたか？", "zh": "啊，谢谢你，青羽小姐。对了，你刚才有没有在哪里见到可怜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1051_102mis", "source_sha256": "7b21fd3e87bbe762c7e5cfb35ddb3a8609e16b3a88a8920f7d43f0462796316f", "ja": "え？　可憐ちゃんなら、さっきすれ違いましたよ。\n階段に向かってたから、たぶん屋上だと思います。", "zh": "诶？可怜的话，刚才和我擦肩而过了哦。\n她往楼梯那边去了，我想应该是在屋顶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1052_p", "source_sha256": "9b8a2a2a09e9ca966bcbc6188b78f9cddd3b28d87bdd3761c360128504db70f2", "ja": "おっ、そうですか。ありがとうございます！\nちょっと様子を見てきますね。", "zh": "哦，是吗。谢谢你！\n我去看看她的情况。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1053_045kar", "source_sha256": "856e0eb510339b3060aa85e9c6d2fc22948bf3c042d733ca837aa1518e81abec", "ja": "…………うぅ。", "zh": "…………呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1054_p", "source_sha256": "e0423335980d6844af2bd18a23c7aba7663127b634fda9bcde19b342e5fb31de", "ja": "可憐？　お疲れさま。", "zh": "可怜？辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1055_045kar", "source_sha256": "ab329b7743d30b8def982a6285b94a33b534bb932054b0fc2a5a01eca52871bf", "ja": "あっ……ぷ、{$P$}さん……！\nお、お疲れさま……です。", "zh": "啊……制、{$P$}先生……！\n您、您辛苦了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1056_p", "source_sha256": "7acbdc1b3bd49f1c889d3dc4fc265c52adac6fb7edcb36fff3854ffefefa2af8", "ja": "どうしたんだ？　なんだか元気がないみたいだけど。\n公演のことで、何か心配でもあるのか？", "zh": "怎么了？感觉你好像没什么精神。\n是对公演有什么担心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1057_045kar", "source_sha256": "e16584705fcb1277606a7b2bd6ba42f51a70358ee22c90f3cd17ad99852125a0", "ja": "そ、それは、えっと……！\n大丈夫、です……た、大した話じゃないので……。", "zh": "那、那个，呃……！\n没事……不、不是多大的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1058_p", "source_sha256": "1e2214f813caef7b6e589b6c2ae0ea4abc38afc461aaa6ac0e75fec2388292a2", "ja": "どんな事でも、話してもらいたいな。\nプロデューサーとして、可憐の力になりたい。", "zh": "不管是什么事，我都想听你说。\n作为制作人，我想助可怜一臂之力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1059_045kar", "source_sha256": "bdfb0543df8ebace27b179c0450f1d74b400c9df65f6c546b16e53d41c54539d", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\nわ、私……、今日の取材で、思ったんです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……。\n我、我在今天的采访中，想到了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1060_045kar", "source_sha256": "7bcbce26552c4be2de0cdfb1fc2ff255904cb6f615bdbf2e9698a7813c032e31", "ja": "あ、あんなに意気込んで……取材を受けたのに……。\n私……全然、成長してないんじゃないか、って……。", "zh": "啊、啊，我明明那么认真地接受了采访……却觉得……自己……是不是完全没有成长……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1061_p", "source_sha256": "7af213afa277befacd6d33454c78a3c9f370b83a5da9f66a863f21308eba2d48", "ja": "えっ？　全然そんな事ないと思うけど。\nなんでそう思ったんだ？", "zh": "咦？我觉得完全不是那么回事啊。\n为什么会这么想？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1062_045kar", "source_sha256": "76c6e9f224e4b3c7ab2a19afdbe1645f0b592f76357cf9773bc817ff2e46968e", "ja": "だ、だって、みんなのほうが、ちゃんとしてて……。\n私……た、助けられて、ばかりで……。", "zh": "可、可是，大家都比我更靠谱……  \n我……总是、总是被大家帮助……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1063_045kar", "source_sha256": "6ed56b133b308ec682deb231e15498b911a82eadd58c3bb924f63d4d3eaad6cf", "ja": "ちょ、ちょっとぐらいは、成長できてるかもって\n思ってたのに……うぅ。", "zh": "我还以为……自己或许也成长了一点点……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1064_p", "source_sha256": "ff0cd9939d407cca8647fba59727c90b558a2a28acc98033c26d6b5a8048ffcc", "ja": "いや……可憐は成長してると思うよ。今回だって、\n自分から取材を受けるって決めたじゃないか。", "zh": "不……我觉得可怜成长了哦。这次不也是\n你自己决定要接受采访的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1065_045kar", "source_sha256": "f9f61dfdc25a1fbabaae7e999e68b8a639b5b720484fbe933e9628a3fc7bd0cf", "ja": "あれは……い、勢いで……。\n……。", "zh": "那是……一、一时冲动……\n……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1066_045kar", "source_sha256": "29c5cc721de562cc4ecb6254fca3150b0bbd4c5bae47dd5275d7c49554a31eda", "ja": "{$P$}さんに「気が休まらないかも」\nって、言われて……本当は、後悔したんです。", "zh": "被{$P$}先生说了“可能没办法好好休息”之后……\n其实，我心里很后悔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1067_045kar", "source_sha256": "d4aa6a9004b16c687ee193de6a2fd1ed525709a9ffbdd7428b39cb8e47262716", "ja": "でも、じ、自分で言い出したこと、だから……。\nやらなくちゃって、それだけで……。", "zh": "但是，这、这是我自己主动提出来的……所以……  \n我必须做到，就只是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1068_p", "source_sha256": "05acbe550566abe835e3240f88f2c42b5ee167acf433f8458d514de42ef464ba", "ja": "うん。だから、ちゃんと引き受けようとして\nくれてるんだよな？　わかるよ。", "zh": "嗯。所以你才想要好好承担下来，\n对吧？我明白的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1069_045kar", "source_sha256": "a443728a8175b991932eba7c1377a7feb90b5c05a89ee687339a5281a0ed75e9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1070_p", "source_sha256": "442815734ab3d13f83bfd3e05aaccc114eed5d2c4dfcd994aef4d6ebbe899b75", "ja": "大丈夫、可憐はちゃんと成長してる。自分では\nわからないかもだけど……昔より前に進んでるよ。", "zh": "没事的，可怜确实在成长。也许你自己\n没有察觉到……但你比以前前进了不少哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1071_p", "source_sha256": "1bf815b31e97b0198f9d6b84fbf68d8377ae2e4b08b1a22e16b2033a9c8cfed1", "ja": "ほら、初めてのセンター公演の時なんて、センターって\n聞いただけで気絶してたくらいだし……。", "zh": "你看，第一次站C位演出的时候，光是听到“C位”就昏过去了来着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1072_045kar", "source_sha256": "873a9ed5be5e8162a8f05bd58de69a0af5b3e2aaa0be1ce1485d23da54193a3e", "ja": "あ、あうぅ、そ、それは……！\nあ、あの時に比べたら、そうかもですけど……。", "zh": "啊、啊呜呜，那、那是……！\n虽、虽然和那时候相比，或许确实是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1073_045kar", "source_sha256": "36a9f4dd12ff487bed8efa6be6eb7c20dfae53b2ba0cc692abf713bb11a97510", "ja": "で、でも、私の成長なんて、本当にちっぽけで……。", "zh": "可、可是，我的成长真的微不足道……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1074_p", "source_sha256": "41439a877001c054baccbe48e71f51305b020f23bc75d801cf4a09b972c07cd2", "ja": "たとえ小さくても、成長は成長だ。そんな可憐だから\nこそ、みんな助けようとするんじゃないかな？", "zh": "哪怕很小，成长也是成长。正因为是这样的可怜，大家才会想要帮助她吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1075_p", "source_sha256": "73547a355f3f8587bb4bb1e815e2f8330de94860ae3a6c8a44212c79d2e36721", "ja": "頑張って、前に進もうとしている可憐だから、\n力になりたいんだよ。俺も同じ気持ちだ。", "zh": "正因为可怜一直在努力、想要向前迈进，我才想助她一臂之力。我也是同样的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1076_045kar", "source_sha256": "b894cdfc04cfba98edaaafa0a32a49eaef09a286c042f16f4c3e38e942d6410e", "ja": "あ……。で、でも……私……。\nい、いいんでしょうか……そんなに、頼っちゃって。", "zh": "啊……可是、可是……我……真的可以吗……这么依赖你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_1077", "source_sha256": "d7dc2c584dab1c79c1051244bd1990da52c55f4f5fffd94bd0097c76a51bd1ca", "ja": "もちろん！", "zh": "那当然！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_2000_p", "source_sha256": "de71bbd678fcf6b953f50c229b4e50b3a49a356fa561ca46b724605fa41113fd", "ja": "もちろん！　精一杯がんばって、それでも\n足りない時は、みんなの力を借りていいんだ。", "zh": "当然了！竭尽全力去努力，即便如此\n还是不够的时候，向大家借一份力也是可以的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_2001_045kar", "source_sha256": "0a2f46c1cda465d6be21488cc1308664ea972b30956787e14686e335f7432ea1", "ja": "みんなの、力を、借りて……。", "zh": "借助……大家的力量……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_2002_p", "source_sha256": "9d8c9c97672c432ba34b0df2210d721395208feb385d3b3a4d0e636da4a065c3", "ja": "なあ、可憐。可憐は新曲のステージ、\nどんな風にしたいと思う？　みんなと一緒に。", "zh": "喂，可怜。你希望新歌的舞台呈现成什么样？和大家一起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_2003_045kar", "source_sha256": "02a85b8959bfb8dbc637ee3dfc120e10f66791b97249fcb150ef18f0cb58f1eb", "ja": "私が、目指しているのは……。\nえっと。ぜ、全然、具体的じゃないかもですけど……。", "zh": "我……我所追求的是……。\n呃，这个。可、可能完全不够具体……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_2004_045kar", "source_sha256": "2357db2a792ca76d87704a36ef82e87b11d3ccebaa0feac873cd5e6d45564ebe", "ja": "私、みんなに……誰にも負けないくらい、\n素敵なステージにしたいですっ！", "zh": "我想要……让所有人都觉得，\n这是谁都比不上的、最棒的舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_2005_p", "source_sha256": "8ef83b92d6ab8c817559af0ddc65f55a5c3cfce59d778ab661aad252fd80ab5f", "ja": "（可憐の力強い声が、夕暮れの空に吸い込まれていく。\n……よく言ってくれたな、可憐！）", "zh": "（可怜充满力量的声音，渐渐消散在黄昏的天空中。……说得好啊，可怜！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_2006_null", "source_sha256": "de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481", "ja": "翌日……", "zh": "隔天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_2007_045kar", "source_sha256": "d689075c5c011dd7015e0184a2aa94561d39c3fd9d73e355e394405e8145a289", "ja": "え、えっと……みんな、ちょっといいかな……？\n言いたいことが、あって……。", "zh": "呃、那个……大家，能听我说几句吗……？\n我有些话想说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_2008_045kar", "source_sha256": "5297a36a870b92e8f602eaf4d0b34f1bd13979d90ba9e642651632ed03b2e80a", "ja": "わ、私、いつも助けてもらってばかりだけど……。\n公演を成功させたい気持ちは、誰にも負けない、から。", "zh": "我、我虽然总是承蒙大家的帮助……\n但我想要让演出成功的心情，绝不会输给任何人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_2009_045kar", "source_sha256": "aa82e1cb0674161643a4823ec3d1ac61cc5864cd3c87aee612a11b99d3fce9da", "ja": "だ、だから……お願いです。\nみんなの力を、私に、貸してくださいっ……！", "zh": "所、所以……拜托了。\n请把大家的力量借给我……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_2010_047sub", "source_sha256": "07f9c06849c5bebde766f9062af0feb432880cc939a1da325b66e563d95dbe48", "ja": "え？　今さら何言ってんだよ、可憐。\nそんなの、当たり前だろ♪", "zh": "咦？现在才说这种话，真是的，可怜。\n那不是理所当然的吗♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_2011_027say", "source_sha256": "dd11584958ad70beef7528598c90c782a2d45253383361f19faa328d6ee48bbe", "ja": "うんうん！\n私、最初から全力で協力するつもりだよ？", "zh": "嗯嗯！\n我从一开始就打算全力帮忙哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_2012_045kar", "source_sha256": "a0ab1bcfe9ea36231e9464914df4f4aff4234ee94c291fa93ed4cfa2d89764da", "ja": "昴ちゃん、紗代子さん……あ、ありがとう。\nわ、私……がんばるから……！", "zh": "昴、纱代子……谢、谢谢你们。\n我、我会努力的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_2013_022ser", "source_sha256": "39d488287c0c5f8ae00936382f6f608d0f6d1b585505f0b4d1a594df70ed2dc3", "ja": "可憐さん！　わたしのことも頼ってくださいね？\n頑張ってお手伝いしますから！", "zh": "可怜小姐！也请多依靠依靠我哦？\n我会努力帮您的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_2014_045kar", "source_sha256": "95496eda41e68b7f5ff7c44ae9ac119c35b087eeb091bf5fcb38e0c7b00f647c", "ja": "星梨花ちゃん……ありがとう。\n頼りにしてるね……てへへ♪", "zh": "星梨花……谢谢你。\n那就拜托你啦……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_2015_008tak", "source_sha256": "b2c7b5250868a42bbc264d111e94a5c59eaadef5f44e4ee7f00c7783988321c9", "ja": "可憐、昨日とは表情が違いますね。\n迷いが晴れたのですか？", "zh": "可怜，你的神情和昨天不一样了呢。\n心中的迷茫已经消散了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_2016_045kar", "source_sha256": "1aa350349a6ab44b50025a0b5dcb120501a97c36657da19a590984fda65b1eb7", "ja": "貴音さん……はい。あの時は私、\nみんなと自分を比べて、弱気になっちゃってて……。", "zh": "贵音小姐……嗯。那时候，我把自己和大家比较，变得有些消沉了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_2017_045kar", "source_sha256": "b3a5e63370c0a46aa857fbcfe88b248ad4d5c612a402e08919703b23a1220169", "ja": "で、でも、私、少しずつでも……。\nみんなの力を借りて……前に進みます。", "zh": "但、但是，我也会一点一点地……借助大家的力量……继续前进。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_087_2018_045kar", "source_sha256": "6c9194cb4a96da45a025b6a10c571e23f3680f6ec708e523835333d920a88d50", "ja": "だ、だから……もう、大丈夫です、\n{$P$}さん！　てへへ……♪", "zh": "所、所以……已经没事了，\n{$P$}先生！嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
